new file mode 100644
index 0000000..62c7888
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changeset/product-storage-conditions.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+"saleor-dashboard": patch
+---
+
+Added a "Storage conditions" field to products. Staff can set it in the Create product dialog and on the product details page, translate it on the product translations page, and include it in the product export. Customers see it in the product description on the storefront. Requires a Saleor core with the `storageConditions` field (3.23 main schema); a build against the staging schema does not load the saved value.
